    "northStar": "Network editorial",
    "overview": "Network editorial places an immediately usable question workspace beside a substantial knowledge-network canvas. Warm ivory supports reading; the dark rail and network establish orientation. Gold identifies actual pending handoffs rather than decorative activity.",
